---
globs: ["**/*.{spec,e2e}.{ts,tsx}", "**/__tests__/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
Stencil test runner (Jest + Puppeteer e2e). Test user-visible behavior: render, session states, callbacks, retry/expiry.
Avoid testing private methods or snapshot-only coverage. Run scoped: `yarn test --spec -- src/components/<name>`.
